{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 274079, "name": "ThinkPad", "username": "thinkpad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-05T19:14:09.455Z", "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://man.archlinux.org/man/dnf.8.en\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The <code>dnf</code> man page</a> discusses <code>autoremove</code> and <code>clean</code> commands, but neither seem to remove package files.</p>\n<p><code>autoremove</code> removes unused packages and <code>clean</code> removes unused repo files. I’m looking for something that removes package files (i.e., files and directories created on install or during use).</p>\n<p>How do you identify and remove these files? Is there a way to do this with <code>dnf</code>?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-05T19:16:34.845Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 94894, "reads": 258, "readers_count": 257, "score": 474311.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ThinkPad", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://man.archlinux.org/man/dnf.8.en", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "dnf(8) — Arch manual pages", "clicks": 330}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16544, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274081, "name": "qwq qwq", "username": "im-crying-qwq", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/im-crying-qwq/{size}/30575_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-05T19:56:17.539Z", "cooked": "<p>You mean config files in your home directory? Package managers aren’t allowed to touch those, you will have to find and delete them yourself.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-05T19:56:17.539Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 599, "reads": 253, "readers_count": 252, "score": 3110.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "qwq qwq", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 4}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 14806, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 4}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 4, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274127, "name": "Jeff V", "username": "computersavvy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T05:29:17.777Z", "cooked": "<p>Packages are removed using dnf <code>sudo dnf remove &lt;package name&gt;</code> which removes all the related system files and if necessary directories.  The config files for the user are, as stated just above, left for the user to find and remove.  Those files will normally be in or under the users home directory or maybe for some may be located under the /etc directory.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T05:29:17.777Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 972, "reads": 237, "readers_count": 236, "score": 4957.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "Jeff V", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 3019, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 3}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274232, "name": "ThinkPad", "username": "thinkpad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T17:11:58.866Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"computersavvy\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"104482\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/48/4741_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeff V:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>which removes all the related system files and if necessary directories</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Does this mean files put in <code>/etc</code> and <code>/var/lib</code> or similar?</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"im-crying-qwq\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"104482\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/im-crying-qwq/48/30575_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> qwq qwq:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You mean config files in your home directory? Package managers aren’t allowed to touch those, you will have to find and delete them yourself.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Is there a way to track these files? I understand some are well named and placed, but to speed up the process and boost assurance, is there a tool that tracks which config files belong to which package? Or another way to ask it is, is there a tool that tracks all the files on your system owned by a certain package?</p>\n<p>I’d like to automate the process as much as possible.</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T17:12:52.570Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 2, "incoming_link_count": 536, "reads": 210, "readers_count": 209, "score": 2727.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ThinkPad", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16544, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274233, "name": "Flo", "username": "augenauf", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T17:15:49.885Z", "cooked": "<pre><code>rpm -ql packagename\n</code></pre>\n<p>will list all files that were installed.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T17:15:49.885Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 134, "reads": 157, "readers_count": 156, "score": 731.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "Flo", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 199, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/5", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274259, "name": "ThinkPad", "username": "thinkpad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T18:35:12.006Z", "cooked": "<p>Thank you, that works well. It doesn’t check the home directory and only works<br>\nwhile the package is installed, but is still usable.</p>\n<p>For now I’ll just make a habit of using a fuzzy finder to cleanup after package removals.</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sh\"><code class=\"lang-sh\">sk -m | xargs -o rm -ri\n</code></pre>\n<p>(<a href=\"https://github.com/lotabout/skim\"><code>skim</code></a> includes hidden files by default, <a href=\"https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/issues/3617\"><code>fzf</code> does not</a>.)</p>\n<p>This also works well:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sh\"><code class=\"lang-sh\">fd -H &lt;pkg&gt; | xargs -o rm -ri\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-07T04:34:01.230Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 195, "reads": 141, "readers_count": 140, "score": 1003.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ThinkPad", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://github.com/lotabout/skim", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "GitHub - lotabout/skim: Fuzzy Finder in rust!", "clicks": 29}, {"url": "https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/issues/3617", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "[Feature Request] Add flag for including hidden files · Issue #3617 · junegunn/fzf · GitHub", "clicks": 7}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16544, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274262, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T18:44:19.735Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"thinkpad\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"104482\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/48/33710_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ThinkPad:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Does this mean files put in <code>/etc</code> and <code>/var/lib</code> or similar?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If those files are modified by user, they are not removed but renamed with <code>.rpmsave</code> extension (to preserve the changes made by the user). If they are not modified, they are removed by <code>dnf remove</code> command.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T18:44:19.735Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 92, "reads": 129, "readers_count": 128, "score": 505.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 16544, "username": "thinkpad", "name": "ThinkPad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/7", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274267, "name": "ThinkPad", "username": "thinkpad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T19:00:48.259Z", "cooked": "<p>Thank you for explaining. Understood.</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T19:00:48.259Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 61, "reads": 109, "readers_count": 108, "score": 326.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ThinkPad", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 1379, "username": "ersen", "name": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16544, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274269, "name": "ThinkPad", "username": "thinkpad", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/thinkpad/{size}/33710_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T19:04:20.046Z", "cooked": "<p>What is this referring to then in the Software app?</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/5/8/58acdb1666eed60037fc4e075f44a19fdec098ca.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cEsmh14rDAgLX65UJXAbF0x90SK\" width=\"662\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p>What <code>dnf</code> command do the two options correspond to?</p>\n<p>To reproduce: install Apostrophe, create and save a new file, uninstall.</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T19:04:20.046Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 173, "reads": 109, "readers_count": 108, "score": 891.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "ThinkPad", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16544, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files/104482/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 274270, "name": "qwq qwq", "username": "im-crying-qwq", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/im-crying-qwq/{size}/30575_2.png", "created_at": "2024-02-06T19:08:04.565Z", "cooked": "<p>This only works with flatpaks.</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 11, "updated_at": "2024-02-06T19:08:04.565Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 9, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 63, "reads": 93, "readers_count": 92, "score": 383.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 104482, "topic_slug": "how-to-remove-package-and-all-its-files", "display_username": "qwq qwq", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color"